{"GetWebAssets does not re-check entryPointAssetsCache after acquiring the write lock, so concurrent cache-miss callers will recompute and the last one will overwrite the cache even if another goroutine already populated it. If a later recomputation fails, it can replace a valid cached value with nil, causing subsequent requests to repeatedly reload assets or return nil assets with errors.": 0.9472454786300659, "In development mode, GetWebAssets acquires an exclusive lock (Lock()) for the entire duration of the file/network I/O operations on every call, unnecessarily serializing all concurrent requests in the dev environment and potentially slowing down page loads.": 0.819587230682373}